{"title":"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the smallest positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e05b716f2698046e122d6b26248e3d623377fb42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2n \\choose n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"44\" height=\"53\" /> is divisible by all the primes between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006\">Mock AIME 5 2005-2006</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=76847\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Pro